secubox-podcaster (1.0.5-1~bookworm1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * Import YouTube : réutilise le coffre à cookies de ytsas (#1100). L'import
    d'une playlist comme podcast échouait (« confirm you're not a bot » /
    âge-restreint) faute de cookies — podcaster lisait /etc/secubox/secrets/
    yt-cookies.txt, absent. `_cookies_file()` résout désormais le premier
    candidat présent et non vide : $PODCASTER_YT_COOKIES, le secret propre,
    puis le coffre ytsas (/data/lxc/ytsas/rootfs/...). podcaster tourne en
    root : lecture directe, toujours à jour, aucune copie à périmer.
  * Reprend les correctifs d'identité/déduplication d'import (identité par URL
    source, saut des épisodes connus AVANT téléchargement) présents dans les
    sources et absents du 1.0.4-1~bookworm2 déployé.

 -- Gerald KERMA <devel@cybermind.fr>  Fri, 21 Aug 2026 08:13:53 +0000

secubox-podcaster (1.0.4-1~bookworm1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * Service now runs unprivileged as secubox:secubox (was root) with UMask=0002,
    matching every other module. uvicorn creates its Unix socket owned
    secubox:secubox so nginx (www-data, in the secubox group) can connect. This
    removes the racy "sleep 1 + chown" ExecStartPost: when uvicorn took >1s to
    bind (it cold-starts in ~4s here), the chown ran before the socket existed,
    silently failed, and left it root:root → nginx "Permission denied" → 502 →
    the dashboard looked empty ("content disappeared"). ExecStartPre now clears
    any stale root-owned socket (sticky /run/secubox). postinst reclaims
    ownership of pre-existing root-owned DB + media. (#761)
  * Audio player: stop rebuilding the episode list on every poll tick (every 4s
    admin / 15s portal) — that destroyed the playing <audio> element, so
    playback halted every few seconds. The list now only re-renders when its
    contents change AND no <audio> is actively playing. /media is served
    Content-Disposition: inline so iOS Safari plays it in <audio>. (#761)

 -- Gerald KERMA <devel@cybermind.fr>  Sat, 27 Jun 2026 16:00:00 +0000

secubox-podcaster (1.0.3-1~bookworm1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * Auto-download: feeds can auto-queue new episodes so the portal + share feed
    stay synced without manual downloads. New feeds default auto_dl=on (UI
    checkbox); per-feed toggle (POST /feeds/{id}/autodl, ⏬ in admin). The
    periodic refresher auto-queues newly published episodes; bounded by
    keep_per_feed. (#726)

